#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectchorus.rst:16 ba42a109b5b845ccb5cb9d06383f45dc
msgid "Chorus effect for thickening and enriching audio with multiple detuned voices."
msgstr "合唱效果，支持多个 voice 的延迟、速率、深度、电平、截止频率和声像控制。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectchorus.rst:21 4fcb25cdf7684273a01adea16eb340b8
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectchorus.rst:23 0e1497fdde114029acb5cc0ce3a885de
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectChorus creates a chorus effect by mixing the original signal with multiple delayed"
" and pitch-modulated copies (voices). This produces a thicker, richer sound similar to multiple "
"instruments or voices playing in unison."
msgstr ""
"**FmodAudioEffectChorus**    通过多个轻微延迟并调制的 voice 叠加出合唱感。你可以控制整体干湿比例，也可以逐 voice "
"调整延迟、调制速率、深度、电平、截止频率和声像。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectchorus.rst:25 04c634a1a0f541aea0dd4633b11127d7
msgid ""
"The effect uses up to 4 voices, each with independently configurable delay, modulation rate, "
"depth, level, filter cutoff, and panning. Use this effect to add warmth, depth, and spatial width"
" to audio."
msgstr "最多使用 4 个声部，每个声部的延迟、调制速率、深度、电平、截止频率和声像均可独立配置，可增加声音的厚度、层次和立体声宽度。"

